  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Implement the Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) related to Green House Gas emissions in the Maldives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective is to increase Maldives&apos; resilience to climate change by increasing the generation of renewable energy (RE) in the energy mix, thereby ensuring energy security while reducing the cost of electricity both environmentally and economically. The Specific Objective of the current project is to support the Maldives in the achievement of its NDC target related to the reduction of GHG emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
